---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Page title="Disclaimer" description={`Important information about how to use content on ${SITE.name}.`} updated="10 November 2026">
  <p><strong>{SITE.name} is a news and education website. Nothing on this site is investment, financial, tax or legal advice.</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>We are not registered with SEBI as an investment adviser or research analyst. Mentions of companies, funds or securities are not recommendations to buy, sell or hold.</li>
    <li>Investments in securities markets are subject to market risk. Past performance does not guarantee future results.</li>
    <li>Rates, rules and figures change. Verify important information with official sources or a qualified, registered professional before making decisions.</li>
    <li>Sponsored or partner content, if any, is clearly labelled.</li>
    <li>{SITE.name} is an independent website and is not affiliated with any other publication or media group with a similar name.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
</Page>
